Next: independent complete corrected008 source audit, then Root's genuine canonical selected Source peer (crediting the full worker audit and Root's own audit). New source reviewers remain exact canonical Root/owner_docs_review; there is no reviewer alias relaxation. The historical owner peer's short nominal is still accepted only at its pinned SHA56a7. Actual metadata Core reviewer is `/root/actual_record_checker`; BOUND/LATE reviewer must remain the different `/root/pubnative_review`.

